-- A flat poster: exact colours, a pattern drawn with a loop, soft edges and a vignette.
create a canvas called pattern, 1080 by 1350, flat.

repeat 9 times as:
  draw a circle called orbit, (70 * $n) big, at 540 560, hollow (2 + $n).
end.
repeat 12 times as:
  draw a triangle called ray, 46 by 150, at 540 110.
  turn it ($i * 30) degrees around 540 560.
end.
draw a circle called core, 150 big, at 540 560.
write "RADIAL" called title in Big Shoulders Display bold, at 540 1150, fit 860.
write "drawn with two loops" called sub in Jost, at 540 1240, size 40, tracking 6.

on the front.
enamel the card in #f4efe6.
enamel the orbit in #1f3a5f, 70% opacity.
enamel the ray in #e4572e.
enamel the core in a radial gradient from #ffd166 to #e4572e, feathered 6.
enamel the title in #1f3a5f.
enamel the sub in #e4572e.
vignette the card, 0.35, in #1f3a5f.
